    <string name="settings_help_lan_title">Direct on your home network</string>
    <string name="settings_help_lan">Use the server\'s IP address (like 192.168.1.5) with the client\'s own port — Transmission 9091, qBittorrent 8080, Deluge 8112 — and leave HTTPS off. Adding a new server also scans your network and offers what it finds.</string>
