    <string name="settings_help_domain">Enter just the host name (torrent.example.com — no https:// prefix), turn HTTPS on, and use port 443, not the client\'s local port. Leave the path empty unless your proxy serves the client under a sub-path.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_portal_title">Behind a login portal (Cloudflare Access etc.)</string>
    <string name="settings_help_portal">If the test says the server answered with a web page, a login portal is in front of the client. Create a service token in the portal and put its headers in the Custom HTTP headers field, one Name: Value per line.</string>
